The Base64 encoded, 160\-bit \fBSHA1\fP checksum of the part. This checksum is present if the multipart upload request was created with the \fBSHA1\fP checksum algorithm. For more information, see \fI\%Checking object integrity\fP in the \fIAmazon S3 User Guide\fP .
