.sp
StorageClass \-> (string)
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
Provides the storage class information of the object. Amazon S3 returns this header for all objects except for S3 Standard storage class objects.
.sp
For more information, see \fI\%Storage Classes\fP .
.sp
\fBNOTE:\fP
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
\fBDirectory buckets\fP \- Directory buckets only support \fBEXPRESS_ONEZONE\fP (the S3 Express One Zone storage class) in Availability Zones and \fBONEZONE_IA\fP (the S3 One Zone\-Infrequent Access storage class) in Dedicated Local Zones.
